      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Vel'Koz disrupts a nearby area, causing it to explode, Knocking Up for 0.75 seconds and dealing (70/100/130/160/190 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage. Enemies close to Vel'Koz will be Knocked Back instead of Knocked Up.",
